      "notes": "Maximum ratings (VCEO -45 V, IC -800 mA); hFE1 100 to 630 at -100 mA and its classification (16: 100 to 250, 25: 160 to 400, 40: 250 to 630); hFE2 60 at -300 mA; VCE(sat) -0.7 V at -500 mA, -50 mA; VBE(on) -1.2 V at -300 mA; TO-92 C1 B2 E3; the ordering information."
    }
