      "electrical": {
        "claims": "Ebers-Moll transistor at a constant gain of ${bf} (the geometric middle of the group's ${hfe_min} to ${hfe_max} at 100 mA), collector and emitter resistances for VCE(sat) and VBE(on); fixtures for the gain at 100 mA and 300 mA, VCE(sat) at 500 mA and VBE(on) at 300 mA.",
        "omissions": [
          "the gain's fall with current: it stays ${bf}",
          "the Early effect: the collector current does not rise with VCE",
          "capacitances and fT, so no switching times",
          "temperature: VBE's -2 mV/C and the gain's rise",
          "second breakdown, the safe operating area and damage past the ratings",
          "device-to-device spread within the gain limits",
          "no manufacturer model qualification"
